WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.910
(soothing music)

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:06.930
- [Instructor] As an admin,

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:10.500
if you need help while using
Microsoft 365 for Business,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.330
you have a number of options.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.293
Let's take a look.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.850
From the Microsoft 365 Admin Center,

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.098
select Help and Support.

00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:22.290
(mouse clicks)

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.837
Enter your question and select search.

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:26.910
(mouse clicks)

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.640
You'll see suggested
answers to your question.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.740
If this didn't answer your question,

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.710
scroll down and select
the contact support button

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.630
to connect with one of our agents

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.285
and choose how you want
to contact support.

00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:40.118
(mouse clicks)

00:00:40.118 --> 00:00:42.448
Enter a title and
description for your issue.

00:00:42.448 --> 00:00:45.615
(keyboard keys click)

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.790
Confirm your contact information

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.640
and choose whether to consent
to the call being recorded.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:58.500
Add a file, screenshot
or video if you have one,

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.050
and then select contact me.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:01.920
(mouse clicks)

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.893
A support agent will then
contact you about your issue.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.610
To get personalized
assistance for both you

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:12.810
and your employees, consider
subscribing to Business Assist.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.596
Select Marketplace.

00:01:14.596 --> 00:01:15.429
(mouse clicks)

00:01:15.429 --> 00:01:17.626
Go to the All products tab.

00:01:17.626 --> 00:01:18.480
(mouse clicks)

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.869
And search for business assist.

00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:24.036
(keyboard keys click)

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.453
Choose details.

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:28.286
(mouse clicks)

00:01:28.286 --> 00:01:30.007
Select the number of licenses.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:30.840
(mouse clicks)

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.803
Then buy.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.550
Once you've placed your order,

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.830
each employee can get personalized support

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.413
and more from the business assist team.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.640
For advanced or complex support needs,

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.920
connect with a Microsoft partner.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.563
In the admin center, search for partner.

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.512
Select Partner relationships.

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:53.345
(mouse clicks)

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:56.434
And then select "learn more
about working with a partner".

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:57.267
(mouse clicks)

00:01:57.267 --> 00:01:59.100
In the article, locate the link

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.053
to find and contact a partner.